# l6-p6-desktop-override-flows

## SOURCE OF TRUTH WARNING

- **Spec**: §1.0 Decision 5 + L6-FR-1.3.20 (quote-role override), §1.3.23 (validation gate override), §1.10.8 (quote-role quality gate invariant) (PRIMARY)
